id: pm-todos-ztuk
title: Make legacy TODO importer share native input and preview contract
description: "The generated todos-import import command cannot deliver file input and exits successfully while skipping. Reuse the native todos importer handler and its arguments/flags metadata. Prove file and glob inputs, nonzero missing input, dry-run preservation and behavioral revert in real non-git CLI processes."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
